<title>UK: TABLE-BT lifts Q1 pre-tax profit 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BT lifts Q1 pre-tax profit 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.4		    vs 9.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     881		    vs 869</p>
<p> Turnover		   3,789		  vs 3,641</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 830 and 860 million stg.</p>
<p>BT said it would take a 500 million pound windfall tax charge as an exceptional item against its second quarter results.</p>
<p>Full company name - British Telecommunications Plc</p>
</text>
